<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf8><meta name=viewport content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>:root{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:0;font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:#faf9f5;color:#141413}img{max-width:100%}[hidden]:not([hidden=until-found]){display:none!important}</style></head><body>
<title>Daliesk Workflow Atlas</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Martian+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap">
<style>
  :root {
    --ground: #EEF1F5; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-2: #F6F8FA; --ink: #12181F; --ink-2: #4E5964; --ink-3: #7B8794;
    --hair: #CBD3DC; --hair-2: #E2E7EC;
    --human: #7B3FA0; --s: #B8690F; --d: #1E4FD6; --store: #1F7F6E; --gate: #B8322A;
    --human-soft: #F0E6F6; --s-soft: #FBEFDD; --d-soft: #E4EBFB; --store-soft: #E0F2EE; --gate-soft: #F9E3E0;
    --focus: #12181F; --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(18,24,31,.08), 0 8px 24px rgba(18,24,31,.06);
    --band-a: rgba(18,24,31,.025); --band-b: transparent;
    color-scheme: light;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --ground: #0E1319; --surface: #151C25; --surface-2: #1B232E; --ink: #E7ECF2; --ink-2: #AEB8C4; --ink-3: #8794A3;
      --hair: #2A3441; --hair-2: #222B36;
      --human: #C08BE0; --s: #E5A24D; --d: #7A9DFF; --store: #4EC2AA; --gate: #F07A6C;
      --human-soft: #2A1F36; --s-soft: #33261A; --d-soft: #1C2742; --store-soft: #163430; --gate-soft: #3A2220;
      --focus: #E7ECF2; --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      --band-a: rgba(231,236,242,.035); --band-b: transparent;
      color-scheme: dark;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --ground: #0E1319; --surface: #151C25; --surface-2: #1B232E; --ink: #E7ECF2; --ink-2: #AEB8C4; --ink-3: #8794A3;
    --hair: #2A3441; --hair-2: #222B36;
    --human: #C08BE0; --s: #E5A24D; --d: #7A9DFF; --store: #4EC2AA; --gate: #F07A6C;
    --human-soft: #2A1F36; --s-soft: #33261A; --d-soft: #1C2742; --store-soft: #163430; --gate-soft: #3A2220;
    --focus: #E7ECF2; --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    --band-a: rgba(231,236,242,.035); --band-b: transparent;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--ground); color: var(--ink); font: 15px/1.5 "Atkinson Hyperlegible", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--ink-3); text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", "Atkinson Hyperlegible", system-ui, sans-serif; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; }
  h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
  h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
  code, .mono { font-family: "Martian Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.82em; }
  p { margin: 0; max-width: 68ch; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: "Martian Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 236px minmax(0, 1fr); min-height: 100vh; }
  .rail { position: sticky; top: 0; align-self: start; height: 100vh; overflow: auto; border-right: 1px solid var(--hair-2); background: var(--surface); padding: 22px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; }
  .brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .brand .name { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .brand .sub { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .rail nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .rail nav .group { margin-top: 10px; }
  .rail nav a { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .rail nav a:hover { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--ink); }
  .rail nav a.active { background: var(--ink); color: var(--ground); }
  .rail nav a .k { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; min-width: 26px; color: inherit; opacity: .7; }
  .rail nav a.active .k { opacity: .8; }
  main { padding: 28px 36px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 44px; min-width: 0; }
  header.masthead { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 24px; align-items: end; padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); }
  header.masthead p { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 16px; }
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; align-items: center; }
  .legend .item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block; }
  .swatch.human { background: var(--human); } .swatch.s { background: var(--s); } .swatch.d { background: var(--d); } .swatch.store { background: var(--store); } .swatch.gate { background: var(--gate); }
  section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; scroll-margin-top: 12px; }
  .section-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .section-head p { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .goal { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .chip { border: 1px solid var(--hair); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink-2); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 11px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
  .chip[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: var(--ground); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .chip:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, .node:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .stepper { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .stepper button { border: 1px solid var(--hair); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 10px; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .stepper .pos { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-2); min-width: 8ch; text-align: center; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .stage-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: start; }
  .diagram { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 10px; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .diagram svg { display: block; }
  .inspector { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 18px 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .diagram-caption { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-3); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .inspector .empty { color: var(--ink-3); }
  .inspector h3 { font-size: 18px; }
  .badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .badge { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--hair); color: var(--ink-2); background: var(--surface-2); }
  .badge.t-D { color: var(--d); border-color: var(--d); background: var(--d-soft); }
  .badge.t-S { color: var(--s); border-color: var(--s); background: var(--s-soft); }
  .badge.t-DS { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--hair); background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--d-soft), var(--s-soft)); }
  .badge.t-GATE { color: var(--gate); border-color: var(--gate); background: var(--gate-soft); }
  .badge.t-HUMAN { color: var(--human); border-color: var(--human); background: var(--human-soft); }
  .badge.t-STORE { color: var(--store); border-color: var(--store); background: var(--store-soft); }
  .badge.new { color: var(--gate); border-style: dashed; }
  .kv { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 92px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px 12px; font-size: 14px; }
  .kv dt { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12.5px; padding-top: 2px; }
  .kv dd { margin: 0; }
  .schema-link { background: none; border: none; padding: 0; font: inherit; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--store); text-underline-offset: 2px; cursor: pointer; font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  table.fields { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  table.fields th, table.fields td { text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair-2); vertical-align: top; }
  table.fields th { color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; }
  table.fields td:first-child { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .svg-node { cursor: pointer; }
  .node rect.box { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--hair); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .node.selected rect.box { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 2; }
  .node text.title { font-family: "Atkinson Hyperlegible", system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .node text.actor { font-family: "Atkinson Hyperlegible", system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: var(--ink-2); }
  .node text.num { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: var(--ink-3); }
  .node text.tag { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 600; }
  .lane-label { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; fill: var(--ink-3); }
  .edge path { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink-3); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .edge.feedback path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke: var(--gate); }
  .edge.feed path { stroke-dasharray: 2 4; stroke: var(--store); }
  .edge.report path { stroke-dasharray: 3 3; stroke: var(--ink-3); }
  .node.st-proposed rect.box { stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
  .node.st-partial rect.box { stroke-dasharray: 12 3 3 3; }
  .node .rev-dot { fill: var(--store); stroke: var(--surface); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .badge.st-implemented { color: var(--store); border-color: var(--store); }
  .badge.st-partial { color: var(--ink-2); border-style: dashed; }
  .badge.st-proposed { color: var(--ink-3); border-style: dashed; }
  .rev { border-left: 3px solid var(--store); padding-left: 10px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .edge text { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: var(--ink-2); }
  .edge rect { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--hair-2); }
  .edge.selected path { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .edge { cursor: pointer; }
  .dim { opacity: .16; transition: opacity .2s; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dim { transition: none; } }
  .hide-labels .edge text, .hide-labels .edge rect { display: none; }
  .stage-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  details.stage { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0; }
  details.stage summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 12px 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; list-style: none; }
  details.stage summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.stage summary .n { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  details.stage .body { padding: 0 14px 14px 60px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  table.roster { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13.5px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
  table.roster th, table.roster td { text-align: left; padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair-2); vertical-align: top; }
  table.roster th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; background: var(--surface-2); }
  table.roster td.mono { font-size: 12px; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  .explorer { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .explorer input { font: inherit; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--hair); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); width: min(420px, 100%); }
  .field-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  .field { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 2px 8px; align-items: baseline; }
  .field .name { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .field .type { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .field .meta { grid-column: 1 / -1; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-2); display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .src { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid; }
  .src.D { color: var(--d); border-color: var(--d); } .src.S { color: var(--s); border-color: var(--s); }
  .count { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sev.landed { color: var(--store); border-color: var(--store); }
  ol.gaps { margin: 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; counter-reset: gap; }
  ol.gaps li { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px 12px 54px; position: relative; counter-increment: gap; }
  ol.gaps li::before { content: counter(gap); position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 12px; font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); width: 28px; }
  .sev { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 10.5px; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid; margin-right: 6px; }
  .sev.blocking { color: var(--gate); border-color: var(--gate); background: var(--gate-soft); }
  .sev.major { color: var(--s); border-color: var(--s); background: var(--s-soft); }
  .sev.minor { color: var(--ink-2); border-color: var(--hair); }
  .council-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .judge h3 { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; }
  .scores { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .score { font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .judge ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .judge .better { border-left: 3px solid var(--store); padding-left: 12px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .pending { color: var(--ink-3); font-style: italic; }
  .revisions { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .revision { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--hair-2); border-left: 3px solid var(--d); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .revision b { color: var(--ink); }
  .note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }

  @media (max-width: 820px) { .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .rail { position: static; height: auto; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair-2); } main { padding: 22px 18px 60px; } header.masthead { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media print { .rail { display: none; } .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .diagram { overflow: visible; box-shadow: none; } .inspector { position: static; } }
</style>

<div class="layout">
  <aside class="rail">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="name">Daliesk Workflow Atlas</div>
      <div class="sub">Four long agentic workflows, one per goal, over the harness as it exists today.</div>
    </div>
    <nav id="nav" aria-label="Sections">
      <a href="#w1" data-nav="w1"><span class="k">W1</span>Harness capability program</a>
      <a href="#w2" data-nav="w2"><span class="k">W2</span>Software factory</a>
      <a href="#w3" data-nav="w3"><span class="k">W3</span>Transcript-to-model</a>
      <a href="#w4" data-nav="w4"><span class="k">W4</span>Fleet observatory</a>
      <div class="group"></div>
      <a href="#principles" data-nav="principles"><span class="k">§1</span>Principles</a>
      <a href="#roster" data-nav="roster"><span class="k">§2</span>Meta-agent roster</a>
      <a href="#schemas" data-nav="schemas"><span class="k">§3</span>Structured hand-offs</a>
      <a href="#facts" data-nav="facts"><span class="k">§4</span>Scoreboard schema</a>
      <a href="#gaps" data-nav="gaps"><span class="k">§5</span>What is missing</a>
      <a href="#council" data-nav="council"><span class="k">§6</span>Judge council</a>
      <a href="#revisions" data-nav="revisions"><span class="k">§7</span>Revisions</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="legend" aria-label="Lane legend" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Lanes</span>
      <span class="item"><span class="swatch human"></span>Humans (sign-off)</span>
      <span class="item"><span class="swatch s"></span>Semantic agents · S</span>
      <span class="item"><span class="swatch d"></span>Deterministic services · D</span>
      <span class="item"><span class="swatch store"></span>Records &amp; stores</span>
      <span class="item"><span class="swatch gate"></span>Gates with authority</span>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Solid edges carry a schema-validated hand-off (its schema is written on the edge). Dashed red edges return work with the failure as its directive. Dotted green edges feed a later consumer. Grey dashed edges are worker reports, never gates. Boxes: solid outline implemented, dash-dot partial, dashed proposed; hatched boxes run outside the session log; a green dot marks a stage the council changed.</p>
  </aside>

  <main>
    <header class="masthead">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Design draft v1 · 2026-09-05, refreshed 2026-09-06 · revised by a seven-judge council · for revision together</span>
        <h1>Four workflows, one deterministic spine</h1>
        <p>Every stage is a plugin. Semantic agents propose inside structured outputs; deterministic services fold the session log, run the verifiers, and hold the authority together with the humans who sign. The same log that runs the fleet is the dataset that trains the model.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="item"><span class="badge t-D">D</span>fold, gate, verifier, replay</span>
        <span class="item"><span class="badge t-S">S</span>critique, synthesis, proposal</span>
        <span class="item"><span class="badge t-GATE">GATE</span>authority</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="w1" data-wf="w1"></section>
    <section id="w2" data-wf="w2"></section>
    <section id="w3" data-wf="w3"></section>
    <section id="w4" data-wf="w4"></section>

    <section id="principles">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">§1</span><h2>Principles shared by the four workflows</h2><p>Each one is enforced by something the repository already has, or names the plugin that will enforce it.</p></div>
      <div class="grid-2" id="principles-grid"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="roster">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">§2</span><h2>Meta-agent roster</h2><p>Every agent is a preset composition. Semantic agents emit forced schemas; deterministic ones fold or gate. No agent judges its own work.</p></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="roster" id="roster-table"></table></div>
    </section>

    <section id="schemas">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">§3</span><h2>Structured hand-offs</h2><p>Every semantic-to-deterministic edge names one of these schemas. A rejected output returns to its producer with the validation error as the directive.</p></div>
      <div class="grid-2" id="schema-grid"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="facts">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">§4</span><h2>Scoreboard schema · <span class="mono">SessionFacts</span></h2><p>One row per session. D fields fold from the session log or the run report; S fields come from judge sessions that are themselves logged.</p></div>
      <div class="explorer">
        <div class="toolbar">
          <input id="field-search" type="search" placeholder="Search fields, groups, sources…" aria-label="Search fields">
          <span class="count" id="field-count"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="chips" id="group-chips"></div>
        <div class="field-grid" id="field-grid"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gaps">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">§5</span><h2>What the documentation and processes already allow, and what is missing</h2><p>Ordered by how much of the four workflows each gap blocks.</p></div>
      <div class="grid-2" id="allowed-grid"></div>
      <ol class="gaps" id="gap-list"></ol>
